2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-01 open Assets:C
2020-01-01 open Assets:D

2020-01-02 * "Amount-less posting"
  Assets:A  10.00 USD
  Assets:B  -3.333 USD
  Assets:C

2020-01-03 * "Currency-only amount"
  Assets:A  10.00 USD
  Assets:B  -3.333 USD
  Assets:D  USD

2020-01-04 * "No stated USD amount: nothing to round to"
  Assets:A  10.00 EUR @ 1.1111 USD
  Assets:B

2020-01-05 balance Assets:C  -6.670 USD
2020-01-05 balance Assets:D  -6.670 USD
2020-01-05 balance Assets:B -17.7770 USD
